        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicholas Barnewall, James II, Patrick Barnewall\n- Places: Grace Dieu Abbey, Paris\n- Events: Glorious Revolution\n\nFacts:\n- In 1541, Patrick Barnewall acquired Grace Dieu Abbey in Paris.\n- Nicholas Barnewall was the grandson of Patrick Barnewall.\n- In 1688, James II was deposed in the Glorious Revolution.\n- Nicholas Barnewall supported James II.",
